OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABid to curb anti-social activity
OL,4,Aat park and rides
OL,5,
OL,6,FPSPOs are already in place at the
OL,7,FMilton and Babraham Road car parks,
OL,8,Fprohibiting dangerous driving, vehicle
OL,9,Fracing, excessive engine revving,
OL,10,Fburnouts, stunts, loud music and
OL,11,Forganised vehicle gatherings. Breaching
OL,12,Fthe restrictions can lead to
OL,13,Fenforcement action and fines.
OL,15,FA consultation on expanding the PSPOs
OL,16,Fis running until 7 December.
